# Local Endpoint Agent

Cross-platform endpoint agent (Linux/macOS/Windows) for direct gRPC communication with:
- ActivityService
- AgentManagementService

Run locally:

```bash
python3 -m endpoint_agent.cli run --config ./config/agent.yaml
```

Generate gRPC Python files:

```bash
bash ./scripts/generate_protos.sh
```

Install helper:

```bash
python3 ./scripts/install_agent.py --computer-id 1
```
